{"4532550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Keep Her Safe", "steam_appid": 4532550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Future Plan</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/89568813c578823a91abee3cfb61edae.avif?t=1787652887\" width=1080 height=3392 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A strange acid rain carrying an unknown virus fell for seven days and seven nights.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity vanished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cities fell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dead began to walk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the animals survived.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And some of them evolved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, as one of the few intelligent survivors left in the wasteland, you'll fight to protect civilization's final hope: an unfinished rocket project capable of ending the acid rain catastrophe once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But before that day comes...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Defenses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/136ba1614fd3176854f770f912becfa4.poster.avif?t=1787652887\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/136ba1614fd3176854f770f912becfa4.webm?t=1787652887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/136ba1614fd3176854f770f912becfa4.mp4?t=1787652887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct defensive structures to strengthen your base against increasingly dangerous threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Protect the Energy Core</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/0e12c27be538f68d1354dfc986d71bbf.poster.avif?t=1787652887\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/0e12c27be538f68d1354dfc986d71bbf.webm?t=1787652887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/0e12c27be538f68d1354dfc986d71bbf.mp4?t=1787652887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Energy Core keeps your base running and powers civilization's last hope. Defend it from relentless zombie hordes at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruit Mercenaries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire mercenaries to strengthen your base defenses or accompany you on expeditions and battles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/0c0f9e6c13a078bf9bb3f7cbbf1a3a67.poster.avif?t=1787652887\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/0c0f9e6c13a078bf9bb3f7cbbf1a3a67.webm?t=1787652887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/0c0f9e6c13a078bf9bb3f7cbbf1a3a67.mp4?t=1787652887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Apocalypse</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/390832f1d80fc4f803dc783a853c9573.poster.avif?t=1787652887\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/390832f1d80fc4f803dc783a853c9573.webm?t=1787652887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/390832f1d80fc4f803dc783a853c9573.mp4?t=1787652887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through the wasteland, complete missions, and endure a world devastated by acid rain and the undead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scavenge the Wasteland for Resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/a5b8e6df3c295486feedbad1db5a88e4.poster.avif?t=1787652887\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/a5b8e6df3c295486feedbad1db5a88e4.webm?t=1787652887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/a5b8e6df3c295486feedbad1db5a88e4.mp4?t=1787652887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dangerous ruins, defeat zombies, and bring valuable resources back to your base. Every expedition helps you survive another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chill with Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/da4eece685eaef80fc6ddc8875c38ac2.poster.avif?t=1787652887\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/da4eece685eaef80fc6ddc8875c38ac2.webm?t=1787652887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/da4eece685eaef80fc6ddc8875c38ac2.mp4?t=1787652887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill with friends in different multiplayer gameplay after a hard fight in the wasteland. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A strange acid rain carrying an unknown virus fell for seven days and seven nights.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity vanished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cities fell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dead began to walk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the animals survived.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And some of them evolved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, as one of the few intelligent survivors left in the wasteland, you'll fight to protect civilization's final hope: an unfinished rocket project capable of ending the acid rain catastrophe once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But before that day comes...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Defenses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/136ba1614fd3176854f770f912becfa4.poster.avif?t=1787652887\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/136ba1614fd3176854f770f912becfa4.webm?t=1787652887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/136ba1614fd3176854f770f912becfa4.mp4?t=1787652887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct defensive structures to strengthen your base against increasingly dangerous threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Protect the Energy Core</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/0e12c27be538f68d1354dfc986d71bbf.poster.avif?t=1787652887\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/0e12c27be538f68d1354dfc986d71bbf.webm?t=1787652887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/0e12c27be538f68d1354dfc986d71bbf.mp4?t=1787652887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Energy Core keeps your base running and powers civilization's last hope. Defend it from relentless zombie hordes at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruit Mercenaries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire mercenaries to strengthen your base defenses or accompany you on expeditions and battles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/0c0f9e6c13a078bf9bb3f7cbbf1a3a67.poster.avif?t=1787652887\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/0c0f9e6c13a078bf9bb3f7cbbf1a3a67.webm?t=1787652887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/0c0f9e6c13a078bf9bb3f7cbbf1a3a67.mp4?t=1787652887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Apocalypse</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/390832f1d80fc4f803dc783a853c9573.poster.avif?t=1787652887\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/390832f1d80fc4f803dc783a853c9573.webm?t=1787652887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/390832f1d80fc4f803dc783a853c9573.mp4?t=1787652887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through the wasteland, complete missions, and endure a world devastated by acid rain and the undead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scavenge the Wasteland for Resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/a5b8e6df3c295486feedbad1db5a88e4.poster.avif?t=1787652887\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/a5b8e6df3c295486feedbad1db5a88e4.webm?t=1787652887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/a5b8e6df3c295486feedbad1db5a88e4.mp4?t=1787652887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dangerous ruins, defeat zombies, and bring valuable resources back to your base. Every expedition helps you survive another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chill with Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/da4eece685eaef80fc6ddc8875c38ac2.poster.avif?t=1787652887\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/da4eece685eaef80fc6ddc8875c38ac2.webm?t=1787652887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/extras/da4eece685eaef80fc6ddc8875c38ac2.mp4?t=1787652887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill with friends in different multiplayer gameplay after a hard fight in the wasteland. </p>", "short_description": "Keep Her Safe is a survival shooting game. Gather resources, fortify your base, and withstand zombie hordes to keep the rocket project alive and bring an end to the acid rain apocalypse. Besides the hard life in wasteland, you can also chill up with friends in different multiplayer gameplays.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/ae035d884f3e40fbba00e4f6cfc93e8a35a1bfef/header.jpg?t=1787652887", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/bb05ae5d28c9c8ef9e47a3566faf76f4bc5b7b10/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787652887", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532550/bb05ae5d28c9c8ef9e47a3566faf76f4bc5b7b10/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787652887", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 / AMD Radeon RX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB a